      "content": "thanks but i dont really want to go to the doctors right now if i dont have to. it was only for like two minutes and im completely back to normal now. it honestly feels like it was just a one time thing, maybe i just stood up too fast or something. do you really think i need to go to the er or see someone immediately if the symptoms aren't even there anymore?",
